 ProcessToolWithLongCaption;globalParms;list;n1
⍝ Presents a list of any length and allows processing selected rows with a REALLY long caption.
 globalParms←##.GUI.APLGuiGlobalParms.CreateDefaults
 globalParms.regKey←'MyApp'
 globalParms.caption←'This is my most favourite application, really!'
 globalParms.icon←#.⎕NEW'Icon'(⊂'File'(GetFile'Sample.ico'))
 list←∪300⍴#.⎕NL-3
 list←list[⍋⊃list]
 n1←globalParms ##.GUI.ProcessTool.Create list'##.GUI_Demo.∆OnTestHandler_ProcessTool'

 {}##.GUI.ProcessTool.ModalWait n1
